          "type": "rich_text",
          "id": "books-orders",
          "variant": "prose",
          "heading": "Copies and bookstores",
          "html": "<p>Copies ordered here are signed and shipped from the writing room within the week. Bookstores and guild libraries can order through the distributor listed on the contact page, and wholesale terms are the same ones every publisher pretends are special.</p>",
