    {
      "slug": "about",
      "title": "About",
      "nav": false,
      "sections": [
        {
          "type": "hero",
          "id": "about-hero",
          "variant": "minimal",
          "title": "About {{guild_name}}",
          "subtitle": "Sample text — replace me: A quilt historian who started asking grandmothers one more question and never found the bottom of it.",
          "style": {
            "bg": "tint",
            "width": "narrow",
            "align": "center",
            "spacing": "airy"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "rich_text",
          "id": "about-body",
          "variant": "two_column",
          "heading": "The writing room",
          "html": "<p>The first book happened because a guild lecture kept running long and nobody minded. The publisher who sat in the back row took a chance, and the second book happened because the first left questions unanswered on purpose, a trick I learned from the quilts.</p><p>Research here runs on county archives, church raffle records, and the letters strangers send after a talk. The monthly letter from the writing room goes out to readers who want the finds before they become chapters.</p>",
          "style": {
            "bg": "none",
            "width": "normal",
            "layout": "framed",
            "motion": "piece_in"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "testimonials",
          "id": "about-quote",
          "variant": "single",
          "items": [
            {
              "quote": "Our lecture ran forty minutes over and the membership voted at the business meeting to blame the bylaws, not the speaker.",
              "author": "A program chair, Tennessee"
            }
          ],
          "style": {
            "bg": "tint",
            "width": "normal",
            "motion": "piece_in"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
