          }
        },
        {
          "type": "rich_text",
          "id": "quote-fees",
          "variant": "prose",
          "heading": "Fees and travel",
          "html": "<p>Lectures and workshops are priced on the fee sheet sent with the reply, and travel is shared when two guilds within an hour book the same week. Guilds that cannot afford the fee should write anyway; the fund from the books table exists exactly for that.</p>",
          "style": {
            "bg": "none",
            "width": "narrow",
            "motion": "piece_in"
          }
